<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Stellest 3D Lens</title>

  <script type="module" src="https://unpkg.com/@google/model-viewer/dist/model-viewer.min.js"></script>

  <style>
    html,
    body {
      margin: 0;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100%;
      background: #020812;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .stellest-hero {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 28% 45%, rgba(60, 165, 255, 0.28) 0%, rgba(7, 24, 39, 0.72) 38%, rgba(2, 8, 18, 1) 78%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #05111f 0%, #020812 100%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .stellest-hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: -10%;
      top: 48%;
      width: 120%;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(125, 205, 255, 0.9), transparent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(72, 175, 255, 0.65);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .model-wrap {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 64%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    model-viewer {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: transparent;
      --poster-color: transparent;
    }

    .content-card {
      position: absolute;
      right: 7%;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 420px;
      z-index: 3;
      color: #eaf7ff;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(234, 247, 255, 0.85);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 76px;
      line-height: 0.95;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      color: #dff4ff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(102, 194, 255, 0.22);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(234, 247, 255, 0.82);
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .info-box {
      padding: 26px 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(137, 207, 255, 0.45);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: rgba(4, 20, 36, 0.58);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      box-shadow:
        0 0 60px rgba(56, 164, 255, 0.16),
        inset 0 0 30px rgba(100, 190, 255, 0.06);
    }

    .num {
      font-size: 54px;
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #8bcfff;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 25px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: #8bcfff;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .text {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: rgba(234, 247, 255, 0.88);
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 34px;
      padding: 15px 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(137, 207, 255, 0.6);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #dff4ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      background: rgba(9, 38, 65, 0.42);
      box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(56, 164, 255, 0.12);
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: rgba(28, 110, 175, 0.32);
      box-shadow: 0 0 34px rgba(56, 164, 255, 0.28);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .stellest-hero {
        min-height: 900px;
      }

      .model-wrap {
        width: 100%;
        height: 58%;
      }

      .content-card {
        left: 20px;
        right: 20px;
        top: auto;
        bottom: 34px;
        transform: none;
        width: auto;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 48px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        font-size: 15px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .info-box {
        padding: 22px;
      }

      .num {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      .label {
        font-size: 20px;
      }

      .text {
        font-size: 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <section class="stellest-hero">
    <div class="model-wrap">
      <model-viewer
        src="./Stellest%202.0.glb"
        camera-controls
        autoplay
        auto-rotate
        rotation-per-second="8deg"
        exposure="1.2"
        shadow-intensity="0"
        camera-orbit="0deg 76deg 4.3m"
        field-of-view="28deg"
        interaction-prompt="none">
      </model-viewer>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <div class="brand">ESSILOR</div>
      <div class="title">Stellest</div>
      <div class="subtitle">Линзы для контроля миопии у детей</div>

      <div class="info-box">
        <div class="num">1021</div>
        <div class="label">микролинза</div>
        <div class="text">
          Создают зону миопического дефокуса, которая помогает замедлять прогрессирование близорукости у детей.
        </div>
      </div>

      <a class="button" href="https://miroptikilubertsy.ru/stellest_linzy_kontrol_miopii_u_detei">
        Узнать подробнее →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
